there is no sense in which one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"such list is stricter than another. A subset rule would force an organization to enumerate","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"every tenant’s resource servers in its own baseline before any tenant could name one. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"model’s rule is “a tenant may only be more restrictive”, which binds every field that ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"has","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a restrictiveness; a field that has none cannot violate it. One cross-field interlock spans","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"both groups and is checked on the resolved policy rather than on either input: see","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"[","type":"text"},{"code":"validate_dcr_policy","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"].","type":"text"}],"title":"OidcPolicy","kind":"symbol"}}}